ended feature?\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3293470977/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5880786970","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110534#issuecomment-5880786970","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110534","id":5880786970,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABXoWwGg","user":{"login":"solodeveloping","id":155950383,"node_id":"U_kgDOCUudLw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/155950383?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/solodeveloping","html_url":"https://github.com/solodeveloping","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/solodeveloping/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/solodeveloping/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/solodeveloping/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/solodeveloping/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/solodeveloping/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/solodeveloping/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/solodeveloping/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/solodeveloping/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/solodeveloping/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-28T23:40:30Z","updated_at":"2026-09-28T23:40:30Z","body":"I have a bug that relates to this.\n\nI have an addon, and I'm instantiating a control, in the control a SubViewPort.\n\nIn this control, I have a Prism.\n\nThen I clear the children, instantiate another node inside.\n\nIn this one a Cube.\n\nThey're sharing the Cube but duplicated:\n\n<img width=\"1298\" height=\"884\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c35a319f-5c43-4add-b907-480707e923c4\" />\n\nIf I go inside the control, they're sharing the Prism (+ the cube):\n\n<img width=\"1379\" height=\"885\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d4074bd9-c6cb-4c62-beb4-a99ebe73234d\" />\n\nI'm clearing the existing children first:\n\n```\nfor child in sub_viewport.get_children():\n\t\tsub_viewport.remove_child(child)\n\t\tchild.queue_free()\n```\n\nIf give him his own world 3d\n\n```\nsub_viewport.own_world_3d = true\n```\n\n<img width=\"1232\" height=\"808\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5ce8d3f1-c5d2-46d2-b6c0-eb15e2a629b4\" />\n\nThen, it does not share it, but obviously, I can't move the cubes and stuff anymore.\n\nThen, I made another test (not own_world_3d):\n\n<img width=\"1283\" height=\"904\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c4a1b086-ed68-45e3-9c67-594acd08a08d\" />\n\nIt's interesting because the node is visible in the editor too.\n\nThen, own world 3d:\n\n<img width=\"1191\" height=\"845\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/840d78b6-fa8f-4082-aeb8-930c12d6e8d8\" />\n\nI guess it's surprising.\n\nHopefully this will help people understand what might be happening (not sure if it's a bug, I guess it's not)\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5880786970/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]